#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:32
msgid ""
"Connect data sources so the AI answers from a source instead of its own "
"general knowledge. The built-in public-data feeds are Korean; anywhere "
"else, bring your own documents, web pages or APIs."
msgstr "Anslut datakällor så att AI:n svarar utifrån en källa istället för sin egen allmänna kunskap. De inbyggda öppna dataflödena är koreanska; på andra platser tar du med egna dokument, webbsidor eller API:er."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:42
msgid "Select Source Type"
msgstr "Välj källtyp"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:51
msgid "Public data — Korea"
msgstr "Öppna data — Korea"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:59
msgid "Your own material — anywhere"
msgstr "Eget material — var som helst"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:126
msgid "Sync"
msgstr "Synkronisera"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:146
msgid "Data credits"
msgstr "Datakällor"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:160
msgid "AI-Curated Knowledge Review"
msgstr "Granskning av AI-sammanställd kunskap"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:162
msgid ""
"Knowledge the AI shelved on its own (always unconfirmed at first). "
"Confirm/edit what is correct, retire what is wrong — see it cited as [AI "
"정리 — 미확인] until reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Kunskap som AI:n lagt undan på egen hand (alltid obekräftad från början)."
" Bekräfta/redigera det som är korrekt, dra tillbaka det som är fel — den "
"citeras som [AI 정리 — 미확인] tills den granskats."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:170
msgid "Reviewed knowledge only: ON"
msgstr "Endast granskad kunskap: PÅ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:170
msgid "Reviewed knowledge only: OFF"
msgstr "Endast granskad kunskap: AV"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:172
msgid ""
"When on, the AI may not cite notes it wrote itself until a person "
"confirms them. Authoritative and hand-entered knowledge is unaffected."
msgstr "När detta är på får AI:n inte citera anteckningar den själv har skrivit förrän en person bekräftar dem. Auktoritativ och manuellt inmatad kunskap påverkas inte."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:177
msgid "No AI-curated knowledge yet."
msgstr "Ingen AI-sammanställd kunskap ännu."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:201
msgid "Corroborated"
msgstr "Bekräftad från annat håll"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:202
msgid "Retired"
msgstr "Tillbakadraget"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:203
msgid "Unconfirmed"
msgstr "Obekräftad"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:207
msgid "Flagged"
msgstr "Flaggad"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:211
msgid "Same topic as an authoritative source"
msgstr "Samma ämne som en auktoritativ källa"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:212
msgid "Matches"
msgstr "Träffar"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:235
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:531
msgid "Open source"
msgstr "Öppna källa"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:240
msgid "Reactivate"
msgstr "Återaktivera"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:251
msgid "Retire"
msgstr "Dra tillbaka"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:274
msgid "Knowledge Items"
msgstr "Kunskapsposter"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:277
msgid ""
"Everything the AI can cite — synced from sources, shelved by the AI, or "
"written in by hand. Search and filter to see what is actually in here."
msgstr "Allt AI:n kan citera — synkroniserat från källor, avsatt av AI:n eller manuellt inskrivet. Sök och filtrera för att se vad som faktiskt finns här."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:284
msgid "Search knowledge…"
msgstr "Sök i kunskap…"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:290
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:291
msgid "All sources"
msgstr "Alla källor"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:292
msgid "Authoritative"
msgstr "Auktoritativ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:293
msgid "Entered by a person"
msgstr "Inmatad av en person"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:294
msgid "AI-curated"
msgstr "AI-sammanställd"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:295
msgid "Derived from data"
msgstr "Härledd från data"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:300
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:366
msgid "Add Knowledge"
msgstr "Lägg till kunskap"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:319
msgid ""
"The knowledge library is empty. Until something is in here, the AI "
"answers subject questions from its own general knowledge — with no source"
" to cite."
msgstr "Kunskapsbiblioteket är tomt. Tills något finns här svarar AI:n på ämnesfrågor utifrån sin egen allmänna kunskap — utan någon källa att citera."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:320
msgid ""
"Three ways to fill it: connect a source above, press Add Knowledge to "
"write in what you already know, or just ask the AI to look something up —"
" it saves what it finds."
msgstr "Tre sätt att fylla det på: anslut en källa ovan, tryck på Lägg till kunskap för att skriva in det du redan vet, eller be helt enkelt AI:n att slå upp något — den sparar det den hittar."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:331
msgid "Retrieved at least once"
msgstr "Hämtad minst en gång"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:332
msgid "With a source link"
msgstr "Med en källänk"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:334
msgid "AI notes reviewed"
msgstr "AI-anteckningar granskade"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:335
msgid "retired"
msgstr "avvecklad"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:339
msgid "Most retrieved"
msgstr "Mest hämtade"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:343
msgid ""
"“Retrieved” means the knowledge search returned it — not that the answer "
"quoted it."
msgstr "”Hämtad” betyder att kunskapssökningen returnerade den — inte att svaret citerade den."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:370
msgid ""
"What you write here is treated as confirmed — you are the source. Tag it "
